  "note": "Rewritten 2026-09-27 from ACTUAL record shapes per schema review (notes/gem-schema-review-2026-09-27.md). Earlier draft described fictional fields (ioc_fingerprint/ioc_value/evidence) and omitted the diffend_harvest kind that carries the campaign payload. Mapping follows the files, not vice versa. 2026-09-28: added wave (may-12|may-26|june-18) + wayback_metadata fields for the June-18 wave recovery. 2026-09-28: added jfrog_inventory fields (versions, version_count, xray_id, in_diffend_corpus, csv_source_url). 2026-09-28: added diffend_sweep_july7 fields (first_publish, in_diffend, http_status, mechanism_notes, mechanism_version_checked, diff_error, name_grammars, jfrog_versions, jfrog_version_count, report_url) for the Lane J July-7 wave sweep.",
  "provenance": "Independent Diffend-sourced collection (Christopher's screenshots + our Diffend pull, May 11-12 2026 go-import meta-tag injection campaign). NOT part of the SwarmTraces dataset (provenance correction 2026-09-27).",
  "record_flavors": "download | extraction | diffend_harvest live in data/gem-ioc-log.jsonl; hit records live in data/gem-ioc-hits.jsonl; wayback_metadata records live in data/gem-june18-wayback.jsonl; jfrog_inventory records live in data/gemstuffer-jfrog-2026-09-27.csv (JFrog's 3,022-package public inventory, ingested 2026-09-27). One index, six flavors.",
  "status": "every burst gem was yanked from rubygems.org -> status=dead (hunt status semantics: live|dead|unknown). Surfaces as labels.gem.status + tags+=['status:dead']."
